  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 308.09 General Permit Terms and Conditions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 308.09 General Permit Terms and Conditions. The general permits established in accordance with this part shall contain terms and conditions for design, construction, operation, public benefit, facility maintenance and monitoring, reporting, financial responsibility, and closure, as applicable.\n\nSource. #14124, eff 11-23-24, EXPIRES: 11-23-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300)",
